 "remarks": "Experience waterfront living at 233 Hillspoint Road, a striking new construction home located directly on Old Mill Beach with panoramic water views. A private elevator is planned to serve all three floors, providing convenient access from the garage to the living areas and up to the private rooftop deck. The planned home combines clean architectural lines with an open floor plan, 9 and 10 foot ceilings and expansive walls of glass that capture natural light and showcase Long Island Sound throughout. The design includes four bedrooms, each with an en-suite bath, highlighted by a spectacular primary suite. The very private rooftop deck offers an exceptional setting for entertaining, enjoying sea breezes and watching sailboats and fireworks over the Sound. The lower level is designed to accommodate a hot tub spa and cold plunge pool, complemented by an outdoor shower. A beach-level covered terrace provides a seamless connection to the beach. A rare opportunity to bring your vision to an extraordinary Westport waterfront setting.",
